        <sbh:mutableNotes><![CDATA[<P> <P><P> LacI binds to this regulator. This part is incompatible with species containing active LacI coding regions. Lactose and IPTG disable the operation of LacI and this regulator. This part is incompatible with environments containing lactose or lactose analogs.]]></sbh:mutableNotes>
