    <sbh:bookmark>false</sbh:bookmark>
    <sbh:mutableNotes><![CDATA[References (unparsed) here: <p>Elowitz, M.B., Leibler, S. A synthetic oscillatory network of transcriptional      regulators. <em>Nature</em> 403, 335-338 (2000). <a href="http://biobricks.ai.mit.edu/BB_References.htm#ELOW00">[ELOW00]</a><br>     <br>   </P> <P> References (unparsed) here: <p>Elowitz, M.B., Leibler, S. A synthetic oscillatory network of transcriptional      regulators. <em>Nature</em> 403, 335-338 (2000). <a href="http://biobricks.ai.mit.edu/BB_References.htm#ELOW00">[ELOW00]</a><br>     <br>   </P> <P>Sequence taken from the repressilator of Elowitz and Leibler (2000). The obtained      sequence was compared to the wild-type sequence for LacI obtained through      a database search. The sequence had been modified from the wild-type in that      wild-type GTG start was changed to an ATG start (note, actual ORF in E.coli      has several GTG starts it would seem). The LVA tag has been added for quicker      degradation.<P> Incompatible with systems containing LacI, lactose, or IPTG.]]></sbh:mutableNotes>
